{"id":1781,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 5月19日下午，机械工程学院在17105教室举办“八五载弦歌不辍，新征程兵工有声”主题汇演活动。来自9个团支部的参赛队伍通过经典曲目演唱、红色故事讲述、经典诵读竞赛等形式，传承五四精神，纪念中北大学建校85周年。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BUm9GaM8UYMRLPMflLDL46kLmGinmAk2oR6folCaUm74L4-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVMSyPLShfnm7sMR74nRnkMzvin7C4nzG4L4NYoR9aMzfFMzGiolW7M46FLm9PnRlJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DE511AF17413D4B575DF3E0339288050/5059BD77/281D5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 452px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BUm9GaM8UYMRLPMflLDL46kLmGinmAk2oR6folCaUm74L4-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVMSyPLShfnm7sMR74nRnkMzvin7C4nzG4L4NYoR9aMzfFMzGiolW7M46FLm9PnRlJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\"></p><p>汇演分为经典曲目演唱、红色故事讲述、经典诵读竞赛三个环节，并穿插知识竞赛抢答。各队伍演唱了《歌唱祖国》《如愿》《强军战歌》《黄河颂》等作品，其中Y250203班的《如愿》情感真挚，Y250201班的《歌唱祖国》气势昂扬；在故事讲述和诵读环节，同学们围绕中北兵工奋斗历程、八项规定精神及党纪党史等内容展开，Y230202班讲述《薪火传兵工，初心铸忠魂》，Y230203班朗诵《清风砺剑，薪火永传》等。经评委打分和观众线上投票，Y250203班获一等奖及最佳表演奖、最佳创意奖，Y250202班获二等奖，Y250201班与Y230203班获三等奖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BozCGiUmL4Lzl8Lf7L8UNVkL7UPol-k8ozUZU4WVUmQVU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yDn1hRU1yPM4G4L4TVMln7MmC8oz78Um7iM4NsUNCPMNWFnRvbnRlDMNVFL4-PM77Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/66FCB170339E5DD664914B15797BF16B/D79D566A/3214A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 444px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BozCGiUmL4Lzl8Lf7L8UNVkL7UPol-k8ozUZU4WVUmQVU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yDn1hRU1yPM4G4L4TVMln7MmC8oz78Um7iM4NsUNCPMNWFnRvbnRlDMNVFL4-PM77Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Boz-GiMzlbozCYLfzvbLR7ZL7Cio7-kYnmGDnRARUNUDMzv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhVMSybLkysLN78nRCsolWRUzAkL7rknRUsLmNDL4LaLzMFozL8n7V2nlMFL4LDLl-Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7E59072A4D679BCA8B0EBD4729633013/934DAFEC/3361B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 445px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Boz-GiMzlbozCYLfzvbLR7ZL7Cio7-kYnmGDnRARUNUDMzv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhVMSybLkysLN78nRCsolWRUzAkL7rknRUsLmNDL4LaLzMFozL8n7V2nlMFL4LDLl-Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BnzGGYLmAkM8WVofRLDUN7YU4rRnllkZMRNinR6RMlUsMR90gihFp2hmCIa0nShVokysnkybU4Q7nm7iMNCaLz-YnRMfUN-4U8M7M4lZMz6FUm62Mm-ZoRVFLm-ioR7Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EE87D9C6DF156F0122D3ABB3CCD75857/B7F62881/22581\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 442px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BnzGGYLmAkM8WVofRLDUN7YU4rRnllkZMRNinR6RMlUsMR90gihFp2hmCIa0nShVokysnkybU4Q7nm7iMNCaLz-YnRMfUN-4U8M7M4lZMz6FUm62Mm-ZoRVFLm-ioR7Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BLN-GDMzWRLmW7Lf8LsMmC4LRLiozvkYozWfLRC4UzGsUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LShVUSyYU1h2o7LZnz98nzfkUmfRLRQ7MznVU8CbnzTRLzTFMN-YnNlbMRMFL4U4nzlJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1EA2BF8C8E84E0BB0C06D54ECF9E9C19/6B2FE943/343E5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 442px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BLN-GDMzWRLmW7Lf8LsMmC4LRLiozvkYozWfLRC4UzGsUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LShVUSyYU1h2o7LZnz98nzfkUmfRLRQ7MznVU8CbnzTRLzTFMN-YnNlbMRMFL4U4nzlJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次活动旨在激发青年学子的爱国爱校热情，传承中北兵工基因，践行五四精神，同时增强纪律意识和规矩意识。以文艺汇演和知识竞赛相结合的形式，有效增强了集体凝聚力。学院将继续围绕纪念建校85周年主题，开展多种文化活动，推动红色基因在青年学生中的传承。</p><p><a></a><a></a>一审一校/潘明宇</p><p>二审二校/王睿彬</p><p>三审三校/王佳敏</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BUm9GaM8UYMRLPMflLDL46kLmGinmAk2oR6folCaUm74L4-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVMSyPLShfnm7sMR74nRnkMzvin7C4nzG4L4NYoR9aMzfFMzGiolW7M46FLm9PnRlJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioR9sgtA8pURcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35887&e=.jpg"}